# fixture identity: small-machine
# fixture element: hard-surface body with boxy generator casing and stepped top housing
# fixture element: vents cut across the front panel and left side
# fixture element: pipes running over the top and down the rear corner
# fixture element: gauge dial mounted on the front control panel
# fixture element: warning/accent colors on hazard stripe and red control knob
# fixture element: four squat feet under the chassis
# fixture element: asymmetrical side pipe and offset control panel on the right face
# fixture asymmetry: right-side pipe, offset gauge panel, and single red knob break bilateral symmetry
# fixture stressor-silhouette: compact machine silhouette mixes boxy body, raised housing, protruding pipe, and squat feet
# fixture stressor-material: noisy small-detail pressure across vents, gauge, warning/accent colors, pipe metal, and dark body panels
# fixture stressor-material: material grouping must keep casing, vents, pipes, gauge glass, and warning/accent colors distinct at scale
# fixture stressor-view: internal-edge suppression risks and isolated-pixel cleanup risks around vents, bolts, panel seams, and gauge rim
# fixture stressor-view: mechanical legibility at game scale from front and three-quarter views despite dense small details
model small-machine
size 16 12 14
palette phase0Props
color casingBlue #465a66
color darkPanel #1f2529
color wornSteel #85897f
color hazardYellow #d9a73a
color gaugeGlass #7fc0c9
color warningRed #b53a2f
material body casingBlue
material dark darkPanel
material metal wornSteel
material accent hazardYellow
material gauge gaugeGlass
material warn warningRed

# hard-surface generator casing and raised motor housing
fill body 2..13 2..7 2..10
fill body 4..11 8..9 4..8
fill dark 3..12 3..6 1..1
fill dark 13..13 3..6 4..9

# feet / skids below chassis
fill dark 2..4 0..1 2..3
fill dark 11..13 0..1 2..3
fill dark 2..4 0..1 9..10
fill dark 11..13 0..1 9..10

# vents on front panel and side: many small dark slats against casing
fill metal 4..11 5..5 0..0
fill dark 4..11 4..4 0..0
fill metal 4..11 3..3 0..0
fill dark 0..0 4..6 4..8
fill metal 0..0 4..4 4..8

# front control panel with gauge/dial and warning accents
fill metal 6..10 4..7 0..0
fill gauge 7..8 5..6 0..0
voxel dark 7 5 0
voxel accent 5 7 0
voxel accent 11 7 0
voxel warn 10 5 0

# pipes, bolts, and asymmetrical right-side machinery
fill metal 5..11 10..10 6..6
fill metal 11..11 7..10 6..6
fill metal 14..14 4..8 7..7
fill metal 13..14 8..8 7..7
voxel metal 3 8 3
voxel metal 12 8 9
voxel dark 14 3 7
voxel warn 14 6 8
